Since `data.md === true`,
this `webc` file will pre-process as markdown first,
before being rendered as webC.

<figure>
  <media-gallery :@from-data="this.gallery"></media-gallery>
</figure>

```html
<!-- this is a code block and should not render -->
<figure>
  <media-gallery :@from-data="this.gallery"></media-gallery>
</figure>
```

This finally solves the issue I've been having!
